      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَأَزِّمٌ</span></b>  <i>Smitten,</i> or <i>afflicted, by</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُزْمَة</span> [or <i>straitness,</i> &amp;c.]: (K:) or <i>expressing pain</i> or <i>grief,</i>
or <i>lamenting,</i> or <i>complaining, on account of the
straitness,</i> or <i>distressfulness,</i> or <i>afflictiveness,</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْمَة</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِدَّة</span>,) <i>of time,</i> or <i>fortune.</i> (TA.)

